@startuml sequence-diagram-UC-004
title Sequence UC-004 Gestion Admin + cascada — FR-011/012/013 / BR-004
actor Admin
actor Professor
participant "Users/MaterialController\n(Adapter)" as Ctrl
participant "ManageMaterialUseCase\n(C-1/C-2/C-3)" as UC
participant "Material / User\n(Entities)" as Ent
participant "Validator" as Val
participant "MaterialRepository\n+ FileBlobRepository\n+ UserRepository" as Repo
participant "FileStorage\n(port)" as FS
database MariaDB as DB

' --- C-1: Professor borra material propio ---
Professor -> Ctrl : DELETE /material/:id (JWT)
' GRASP Controller — Mission: single entry point per system operation, UI stays thin
Ctrl -> UC : deleteMaterial(callerId, id)
' GRASP Information Expert — Mission: co-locate behavior with information
UC -> Ent : material.isOwnedBy(callerId) [ajeno y no Admin -> 403, nada eliminado]
Ent --> UC : true
UC -> Repo : deleteWithBlob(id) [transaccion]
Repo -> DB : DELETE materials + DELETE file_blobs (C-1)
DB --> Repo : ok
UC -> FS : remove(storageKey) [E-001 -> 500 + rollback]
FS --> UC : ok
UC --> Ctrl : 204
Ctrl --> Professor : 204 (GET material/file -> 404)

' --- C-3: Admin borra cualquier material ---
Admin -> Ctrl : DELETE /material/:id (JWT Admin)
Ctrl -> UC : deleteMaterial(adminId, id) [rol Admin salta ownership, FR-012]
UC -> Repo : deleteWithBlob(id)
Repo -> DB : DELETE materials + DELETE file_blobs (C-3)
DB --> Repo : ok
UC -> FS : remove(storageKey)
FS --> UC : ok
UC --> Ctrl : 204

' --- C-2: Admin borra cuenta Professor con cascada ---
Admin -> Ctrl : DELETE /users/:id (JWT Admin)
Ctrl -> UC : deleteUser(adminId, userId)
UC -> Val : validateTarget (existe -> 404 si no; 403 si no Admin)
Val --> UC : ok
' Un UseCase por flujo, sin God-controller — High Cohesion + Low Coupling
UC -> Repo : deleteCascade(userId) [transaccion: cuenta + N materials + N blobs]
Repo -> DB : DELETE users CASCADE materials CASCADE file_blobs (C-2)
DB --> Repo : ok
UC -> FS : remove(cada storageKey) [fallo -> 500 + rollback total]
FS --> UC : ok
UC --> Ctrl : 204

note over Ctrl, UC : Sin PATCH owner/transfer v1 (FR-014 eliminada). 401 antes que 404 sin JWT (BR-002).
@enduml
